  "description": "CR 607.2a, 406.6, 118.9, 614.1a, 111.1: Quintorius's end-step trigger exiles target noncreature, nonland card from alice's graveyard and makes a 3/2 red and white Spirit; its activated ability, sacrificing that Spirit, lets her cast the card it exiled without paying its mana cost, and the resolved spell goes to the bottom of her library instead of her graveyard",
